{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想為生日、紀念日、考試與旅行等重要日子留下專屬記錄，Annidiem 以卡片方式整理每個值得記住的日期，適合喜歡回顧生活片段與安排倒數的人。此 App 現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-157.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>翻卡記錄重要日子</h2>\n<p>Annidiem 將生日、紀念日、考試、旅行等重要日子化成卡片，翻開即可記錄照片、想法、語音與短片，並附上當下地點和天氣。不想留意的日子可收進封存區，日記與相片仍會保留；同一天每年各自獨立。程式另有倒數、動態島、小工具、Apple Watch 同步，以及 iPhone 15 Pro 或以上可用的離線人工智能祝福，讓日期與回憶更有條理。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-81.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-82.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-83.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-84.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-85.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-86.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Annidiem</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/annidiem/id6811499781?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.509245+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T02:45:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:38.990022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:38.990022+00:00","content_hash":"a3e87a91897539dfc100df37cdd823f0de3ea2e903e32841697c876f9f3331cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}